  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197526",
      "title": "Using \"Cascading Styles\"",
      "lectureOrder": 68,
      "videoOrder": 65,
      "sourceHash": "71d83ffde6e8a3d0279c90d412b50cf3681fc41ce8549e7c724c6a9a12e4b78b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.38,
          "end": 4.95,
          "en": "So let's now continue on this game screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.95,
          "end": 6.853,
          "en": "with these buttons here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.09,
          "end": 9.74,
          "en": "Here in the game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.74,
          "end": 12.603,
          "en": "we already have this card as a container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.47,
          "end": 15.98,
          "en": "Then we have this view, which holds these two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.98,
          "end": 19.94,
          "en": "And I'd like to position these buttons next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.94,
          "end": 22.23,
          "en": "For this, we need to convert this view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.23,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "from flex direction column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 26.743,
          "en": "which is the default to flex direction row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.76,
          "end": 29.21,
          "en": "Therefore that's what I'll do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.21,
          "end": 32.93,
          "en": "I'll add a buttons container here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.93,
          "end": 35.59,
          "en": "And as a side note, we have a similar container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.59,
          "end": 37.07,
          "en": "on the start game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.07,
          "end": 39.05,
          "en": "And yes, we could outsource this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.05,
          "end": 42.14,
          "en": "into a separate reusable component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.14,
          "end": 44.57,
          "en": "Here I'll not do it because it's just one line",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.57,
          "end": 46.77,
          "en": "of code, one line of styling anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.77,
          "end": 47.88,
          "en": "This line here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 51.24,
          "en": "But you could absolutely create a reusable component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.24,
          "end": 52.82,
          "en": "for this button row as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.82,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 56.21,
          "en": "You could even create a reusable component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.21,
          "end": 57.9,
          "en": "that holds these two buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.9,
          "end": 59.69,
          "en": "if you wanted to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.69,
          "end": 62.47,
          "en": "That would absolutely be possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.47,
          "end": 64.64,
          "en": "Here I will not do that though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.64,
          "end": 66.44,
          "en": "to keep things a bit simpler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.44,
          "end": 68.81,
          "en": "I will just add this view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.81,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "And again, wrap these individual buttons interviews",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 76.59,
          "en": "for the same reasons as before on the start game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.59,
          "end": 77.71000000000001,
          "en": "And then I can copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.71000000000001,
          "end": 82.52,
          "en": "over the button and buttons container style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 82.52,
          "end": 85.563,
          "en": "these two style objects, and add them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.16,
          "end": 89.97,
          "en": "And then I'll add these styles to these views.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 94.21000000000001,
          "en": "So this outer view receives the buttons container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.21000000000001,
          "end": 99.21000000000001,
          "en": "and this interview receives the button container, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 103.68299999999999,
          "en": "And also this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.81,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "With that done, if we save this, this looks better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 112.50999999999999,
          "en": "just some spacing would maybe be nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.50999999999999,
          "end": 113.8,
          "en": "And to achieve that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.8,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "I actually wanna add some spacing below the instruction text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 120.133,
          "en": "or above this buttons container row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.1,
          "end": 124.24,
          "en": "Now we could easily add it to this buttons container row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.24,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "but I'll add it to the instruction text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 127.97,
          "en": "so that I can also show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.97,
          "end": 130.77,
          "en": "another key concept and technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.77,
          "end": 133.28,
          "en": "that you you will likely use quite a bit when working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.28,
          "end": 137.84,
          "en": "with React Native, keep in mind that we're not using CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.84,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "so we have no cascading styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 142.26,
          "en": "We have no inheritance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.26,
          "end": 146.4,
          "en": "But we can kind of replicate a similar behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 148.57,
          "en": "What if we want to add some extra styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.57,
          "end": 151.85,
          "en": "to this instruction text that should be applied in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.85,
          "end": 154.73,
          "en": "addition to the styles applied already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.73,
          "end": 158.21,
          "en": "inside of the instruction text component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.21,
          "end": 162.13,
          "en": "Well, we can use props in the instruction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.13,
          "end": 163.09,
          "en": "text component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.09,
          "end": 165,
          "en": "Besides getting the children,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165,
          "end": 167.49,
          "en": "we could expect a style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.49,
          "end": 170.57,
          "en": "Though the name is up to you and doesn't have to be style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.57,
          "end": 173.41,
          "en": "but I will use style since that is the prop we used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.41,
          "end": 176.363,
          "en": "on all these other components all the time for styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.22,
          "end": 181,
          "en": "So now we get this style prop here on instruction text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181,
          "end": 185.14,
          "en": "and we can now merge the styles we get from this style prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.14,
          "end": 188.85,
          "en": "with the styles, we set up inside of this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.85,
          "end": 193.04,
          "en": "which allows us to kind of build such a cascading structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.04,
          "end": 195.36,
          "en": "because we can now pass styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.36,
          "end": 198.39,
          "en": "from a parent component into this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 198.39,
          "end": 201.343,
          "en": "and merge it with the component specific styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.36,
          "end": 203.98,
          "en": "Now this can easily be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.98,
          "end": 207.35,
          "en": "by wrapping our styles into an array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.35,
          "end": 211.06,
          "en": "Because the style prop does not just take style objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.06,
          "end": 214.41,
          "en": "it also takes an array of style objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 214.41,
          "end": 216.82999999999998,
          "en": "If you do pass an array, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.82999999999998,
          "end": 221.12,
          "en": "the items are parsed and evaluated from left to right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.12,
          "end": 223.75,
          "en": "So the right items, and the styles defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.75,
          "end": 227.32,
          "en": "in the right items, can overwrite the styles defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.32,
          "end": 228.69299999999998,
          "en": "in the earlier items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.55,
          "end": 232.77,
          "en": "So here I add the style that's coming in through props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.77,
          "end": 234.91,
          "en": "and I add it as a last item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.91,
          "end": 237.82999999999998,
          "en": "so that we could overwrite styles that are defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 237.82999999999998,
          "end": 240.2,
          "en": "in this default style set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 240.2,
          "end": 243.75,
          "en": "So that we could override these default styles from outside,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.75,
          "end": 247.963,
          "en": "and for example, assign a bigger font size if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.83,
          "end": 250.82,
          "en": "So now we accepted this style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.82,
          "end": 253.35,
          "en": "We added to this array and we added such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.35,
          "end": 256.18,
          "en": "that the default styles could be overwritten,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 256.18,
          "end": 258.83,
          "en": "but we can of course now also add new styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.83,
          "end": 262.28,
          "en": "besides overriding default styles, by simply going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.28,
          "end": 264.95,
          "en": "to the place where this component is used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 264.95,
          "end": 266.8,
          "en": "in this case the game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 266.8,
          "end": 268.73,
          "en": "and adding this new style prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 268.73,
          "end": 271.63,
          "en": "as a prop to instruction text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 271.63,
          "end": 275.31,
          "en": "And then here, I'll add a new style object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 275.31,
          "end": 278.94,
          "en": "The instruction text object, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.94,
          "end": 280.033,
          "en": "name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.94,
          "end": 284.59000000000003,
          "en": "and I'll add a margin to the bottom of 12.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.59000000000003,
          "end": 286.75,
          "en": "So I'm not overriding any styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286.75,
          "end": 289.803,
          "en": "I'm just setting an additional margin to the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 291.4,
          "end": 295.36,
          "en": "And now we can add this here like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 296.89,
          "end": 298.93,
          "en": "but this is an important technique,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.93,
          "end": 303.04,
          "en": "which allows you to rebuild this cascading nature of CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.04,
          "end": 306.81,
          "en": "in react native, by simply passing this style prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.81,
          "end": 310.19,
          "en": "into a component and then merging the incoming styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.19,
          "end": 313.75,
          "en": "with the existing styles, possibly as we're doing it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 313.75,
          "end": 317.5,
          "en": "such that you could override the default styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 317.5,
          "end": 319.36,
          "en": "Though of course you could also add style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 319.36,
          "end": 322.27,
          "en": "in front of the default styles if you want to ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.27,
          "end": 325.26,
          "en": "that the default styles override the incoming styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.26,
          "end": 327.51,
          "en": "if there are any clashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.51,
          "end": 329.03,
          "en": "This is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 329.03,
          "end": 331.52,
          "en": "and depends on the exact use case you have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.52,
          "end": 333.04,
          "en": "Here I will add it such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.04,
          "end": 335.653,
          "en": "that we could override the default styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 336.87,
          "end": 339.86,
          "en": "And with this, we now have this margin to the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 339.86,
          "end": 343.193,
          "en": "and a bit more spacing between this text and the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
